    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d283">

                <pb facs="0304" n="292" sameAs="frus:frus1943v05/pg292"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">831.24/479: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Ambassador in Venezuela</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Corrigan</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-03-10T11:00:00-04:00">March 10, 1943—11
                        a.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>169. Embassy’s 185 of February 16.<anchor n="6" xml:id="d283-f1"/> In the absence
                    of any further advice, the Board of Economic Warfare has announced in Current
                    Export Bulletin No. 80, dated March 5,<anchor n="8" xml:id="d283-f2"/> that the
                    Decentralization plan<anchor n="9" xml:id="d283-f3"/> will become effective
                    April 1. Wire confirmation immediately.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Welles</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d283-f1" n="6" xml:id="d283-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d283-f2" n="8" xml:id="d283-f2-content">
                <p>Issued by the Office of Exports of the Board of Economic Warfare.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d283-f3" n="9" xml:id="d283-f3-content">
                <p>Decentralization Plan A; for an outline of this plan, see circular airgram of
                    January 19, 8 p.m., <ref target="#pg106">p. 106</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
